# Discoverable universes for the Open Universe start-screen "Universe" dropdown.
# Each label registers a universe (type: universe/<key>). The primary format names
# a single merged `universe:` AMD file (identity + sides + jobs + narrative in one
# place - see UNIVERSE_CHANGES.md capstone). Legacy labels may instead name split
# `sides:` / `narrative:` files; the loader falls back to those (universe_file).
# Add more universes by adding more labels here.

=== universe_default
metadata:``` yaml
type: universe/default
key: default
display: Default
universe: default.amd
```
    ->END

# The worked example from the writer's walkthrough (mkdocs/docs/writing/).
# Copy this label + silver_reach.amd to start a new universe.
=== universe_silver_reach
metadata:``` yaml
type: universe/silver_reach
key: silver_reach
display: The Silver Reach
universe: silver_reach.amd
```
    ->END

# Archetype D (FOUNDATION_PLAN.md): a minimal single-ship STORY universe -
# Mode: story (RTS off), a distress beacon, a win on scanning the derelict.
=== universe_scout_signal
metadata:``` yaml
type: universe/scout_signal
key: scout_signal
display: The Fading Signal
universe: scout_signal.amd
```
    ->END

# Archetype A (FOUNDATION_PLAN.md): a multi-admiral PvP SKIRMISH universe -
# Mode: skirmish (hostile player sides, brisk economy, last-standing victory).
=== universe_skirmish_arena
metadata:``` yaml
type: universe/skirmish_arena
key: skirmish_arena
display: Skirmish - The Broken Accord
universe: skirmish_arena.amd
```
    ->END
